{"c":[{"id":"2c2a04358afd7dde","sum":"Fixture --foreground takes the front in ~100 ms on 'activate legacy' and 'quit PID' returns it in ~250 ms (B9). Every Jev request takes screen text through a SnippetLedger and sets req.snippets; privacy.test fails on undeclared lines or over-budget windows (B10).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T032315Z-0691c078778b7697","text":"CaretFixture.app --foreground becomes frontmost in ~100 ms on stdin 'activate legacy' (NSApp.activate(ignoringOtherApps:)); macOS 14 NSApp.activate() never did from the background; 'quit PID' hands the foreground back within ~250 ms (B9, run-activation-proof.sh).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T043507Z-396591a0dafeb49c","text":"Every Jev request builder must take its screen text through a SnippetLedger (helper/src/privacy.ts) and set req.snippets; test/privacy.test.ts fails on any undeclared window line, over 1,200 chars from one window, or half of a non-card window (B10).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f287a62811635a9e","sum":"Routine proof follows the level (Balanced 3 silent hits, Eager 2, off at Quiet; offers/settings.ts LEVELS); tests and evals built on two hits pass settings level eager (B10).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T043510Z-072d273b831b9d6f","text":"x","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T043537Z-5d59f5b5da2447c5","text":"Routine proof follows the level (Balanced 3 silent hits, Eager 2, off at Quiet; helper/src/offers/settings.ts LEVELS); tests and evals built on two hits pass settings level eager (B10).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
